Starbucks Beverage Analysis Dashboard.

📊 Project Overview

An interactive Power BI dashboard created to analyze Starbucks beverage data and identify insights related to calories, sugar, caffeine, and beverage categories.

🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- Power BI
- Power Query
- Data Visualization
- Data Analysis

📈 Dashboard Features

- Total Beverage Count
- Average Sugar Analysis
- Average Calories Analysis
- Average Calories by Beverage Category
- Average Caffeine by Category
- Top 5 Highest Caffeine Beverages
- Beverage Category Distribution
- Interactive filters and slicers

🔍 Key Insights

- Compared calorie levels across different beverage categories.
- Analyzed average caffeine content across categories.
- Identified beverages with the highest caffeine levels.
- Analyzed sugar and calorie patterns across Starbucks beverages.
- Created an interactive dashboard for easy exploration of the data.

